WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.669
Speaker 1: Starting two days ago, there was
this question What about a domestic travel

00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:09.580
vaccine requirement to get on a plane simply
to get on a plane in the U.S. from one coast

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.580
to another?

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.580
Not internationally?

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.830
What about requiring vaccines?

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:19.880
Major controversial aspect that is being considered,
Dr. Fauci saying it would be reasonable, but

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.470
I'm not saying one way or the other whether
I'm recommending it.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:29.560
The latest news is that Joe Biden now says
if his medical team advises it, he will issue

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:36.270
the domestic travel vaccine requirement and
the anti-vax people are going absolutely nuts.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:40.770
President Joe Biden said yesterday he would
impose a mandate that Americans must be vaccinated

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:45.340
against COVID to travel domestically if his
medical team recommends it.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:49.960
When asked when he would make a decision on
that, he said When I get a recommendation

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:54.700
from the medical team, the idea of mandating
COVID vaccines for domestic travel has been

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.400
bouncing around for months.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:01.940
The emergence of the Chron variant caused
the White House to revisit this question.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:06.170
Biden said last month he would wait for the
scientific community to give him a recommendation.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:12.619
Fauci said Monday anything that could get
people more vaccinated would be welcome and

00:01:12.619 --> 00:01:17.270
said that it would be reasonable, but that
he doesn't necessarily expect that, he said.

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:22.070
I doubt if we're going to see something like
that in the reasonably foreseeable future.

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:26.069
Jen Psaki last month said it's not being taken
off the table, but it will depend on the medical

00:01:26.069 --> 00:01:27.150
and health experts.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.350
So there's two interpretations of this medical
and health expert thing.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:36.329
On the one hand, it's very refreshing after
the prior four years to hear a president say,

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.880
I'm going to listen to the medical team.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:39.240
It's not about what I want.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:40.520
That's great.

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:43.679
At the same time, Joe Biden has sometimes
used this.

00:01:43.679 --> 00:01:48.479
I will wait for recommendations to really
just do nothing, and we've seen that used

00:01:48.479 --> 00:01:51.659
it in a couple of different instances outside
of COVID.

00:01:51.659 --> 00:01:56.810
I think it's really important, just to be
honest, about what such a mandate would achieve

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:03.179
and what it would not achieve this if you
do a vaccine travel mandate.

00:02:03.179 --> 00:02:08.459
The biggest accomplishment that it would push
is getting more people vaccinated.

00:02:08.459 --> 00:02:14.129
We have seen that when people are polled about
would this or that convince you to get a vaccine?

00:02:14.129 --> 00:02:17.370
This is polling people who have not yet been
vaccinated, and at this point, the vaccines

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:21.959
have been available so long that there's real
questions about, you know, what?

00:02:21.959 --> 00:02:24.220
What, if anything, would get those people
motivated.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:28.239
The $100 bonus was not a big motivating factor.

00:02:28.239 --> 00:02:33.180
But when people were asked if you were required
to have a vaccine to fly, would that make

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.280
you go and get vaccinated?

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:40.450
And that was the the one stipulation that
got the highest number of people to say I

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:44.019
would, and it was something like 40 percent
in a poll a couple of months ago.

00:02:44.019 --> 00:02:49.560
So such a requirement would get a lot more
people vaccinated, I believe.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:56.020
At the same time, right now as Amr Akron becomes
a larger and larger share of the infections,

00:02:56.020 --> 00:03:00.670
the effect on keeping infections down is going
to be modest.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.340
It will be greater than zero.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:03.410
There's no doubt about it.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:09.620
It's believed that in fact, actually that
if you have three doses, you are up to 75

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.730
percent percent percent protected against
symptomatic COVID.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:22.430
But there is a real question as to what it
will do overall for spread versus keeping

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:27.810
people out of the hospital and alive, and
it will do a lot as far as that is concerned.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:33.349
It would be crushing politically, I believe,
to Joe Biden in the media to do a vaccine

00:03:33.349 --> 00:03:35.760
travel requirement domestically.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:41.909
But if you look at the polling of what people
think just generally in the general population,

00:03:41.909 --> 00:03:43.870
it's not an unpopular provision.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:47.439
I think this is one of those things where
if there were to be a domestic vaccine travel

00:03:47.439 --> 00:03:52.140
requirement, right wing media would go crazy
and there would be some very loud voices saying

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:54.080
it's absolutely terrible.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.080
But the.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:04:00.530
Country seems sort of 50-50 on such a requirement,
and half the country already hates Joe Biden,

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.280
I think it's basically the same half.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:05.969
I think a lot of the people that already hate
him are the people against the vaccine travel

00:04:05.969 --> 00:04:06.969
requirement.

00:04:06.969 --> 00:04:13.430
So it is not something I actually expect to
see any time soon.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.920
But Joe Biden says he would certainly be willing.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:18.209
Let me know if you think it's something we
will see.

00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:22.060
I do not believe we will see that any time
soon.

